'''June Gauntlet II''' (続・6月強襲！, ''Zoku・6 Gatsu Kyōshū ！'', '''Continued・June Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during June and was added in the [[Version 10.6 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Forbidden Bride Pt II (Monthly Event)|Forbidden Bride Pt II]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
June Gauntlet II contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Forbidden II Lvs''' (続・禁断 Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Forbidden II Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[June Gauntlet II/Forbidden II Lv.11~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*June Gauntlet II is unlocked after clearing [[The Forbidden Bride (Monthly Event)|The Forbidden Bride]] and [[Forbidden Bride Pt II (Monthly Event)|Forbidden Bride Pt II]].

